<view class="showcase">
  <view class="showcase-masthead"><view class="brand-mark">医</view><text class="brand-name">医者</text><text class="demo-pill">交互演示</text></view>
  <view class="showcase-hero">
    <view class="eyebrow">医学学习 · 从理解到掌握</view>
    <view class="showcase-title"><view>把理解，</view><view>变成会用。</view></view>
    <view class="showcase-description">围绕一张知识卡，亲手走过预习、上课、做题、改错与复习。</view>
    <view class="access-note"><view class="access-dot"/><text>免登录 · 无需邀请码</text></view>
    <button class="primary-action" hover-class="action-pressed" bindtap="start" aria-label="开始完整学习演示"><view class="primary-layout"><text>开始完整体验</text><text>↗</text></view></button>
    <button wx:if="{{canResume && !completed}}" class="resume-action" hover-class="action-pressed" bindtap="resume">继续上次体验 →</button>
  </view>
  <view class="journey-panel">
    <view class="panel-label">这一轮，你会经历</view>
    <view class="journey-steps">
      <view class="journey-step preview"><text>预习</text><view/><text>发现盲点</text></view>
      <view class="journey-step classroom"><text>上课</text><view/><text>理解知识</text></view>
      <view class="journey-step practice"><text>做题</text><view/><text>检验运用</text></view>
      <view class="journey-step correction"><text>改错</text><view/><text>找到原因</text></view>
      <view class="journey-step review"><text>复习</text><view/><text>主动回忆</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="sample-topic"><text>本次示例</text><text>第一心音强度的判断规律</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="highlights">
    <view class="section-heading"><text>也可以从这里开始</text><text>自由探索</text></view>
    <button class="feature-entry correction-entry" hover-class="entry-pressed" bindtap="openCorrection"><view class="entry-layout">
      <view class="entry-symbol">↳</view><view class="entry-copy"><text>AI 错因归因</text><text>选择错因，核对并修改复盘建议</text></view><text class="entry-arrow">→</text>
    </view></button>
    <button class="feature-entry classroom-entry" hover-class="entry-pressed" bindtap="openClassroom"><view class="entry-layout">
      <view class="entry-symbol">≋</view><view class="entry-copy"><text>知识课堂</text><text>结构化知识卡与局部 AI 解析</text></view><text class="entry-arrow">→</text>
    </view></button>
    <button class="feature-entry review-entry" hover-class="entry-pressed" bindtap="openReview"><view class="entry-layout">
      <view class="entry-symbol">↺</view><view class="entry-copy"><text>主动回忆</text><text>先独立回忆，再揭晓答案</text></view><text class="entry-arrow">→</text>
    </view></button>
  </view>
  <view class="demo-explanation"><view class="note-title">关于这次体验</view><text>使用精选示例内容与预先准备的 AI 回答。进度只保存在当前浏览器，可随时重置。</text></view>
  <button class="details-toggle" bindtap="toggleDetails" aria-expanded="{{showDetails}}">项目说明 <text>{{showDetails ? '−' : '+'}}</text></button>
  <view wx:if="{{showDetails}}" class="project-details">
    <view><text>真实页面，完整链路</text><text>演示复用医者现有 H5 的知识卡、微测、答题、改错与复习页面。</text></view>
    <view><text>AI 辅助，用户确认</text><text>归因建议可以编辑，确认后进入复测；演示中的 AI 回答均为预置示例。</text></view>
    <view><text>独立的演示环境</text><text>无需注册，不读取内测账号，也不提交正式学习记录。</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="showcase-footer"><text>医者 · 学习产品作品展示</text><button bindtap="reset" aria-label="清除本浏览器的演示进度">重置演示</button></view>
</view>
